#Протокол_WorkGraph_Release_Gate_Matrix_V1<[
Базис:
  ioHasC CI разделяет Vitest, Playwright, integrity, optional LLM; Work Graph rebuild нужен явный mandatory/optional release gate matrix без смешивания model quality и code correctness.
Вектор:
  Tiers:
  mandatory — npm run test:deterministic + npm run lint:backlog (входит в ci:mandatory).
  mandatory-integration — daemon/live-loop fixture tests в deterministic suite.
  optional-env — npm run test:optional:onebase (Go toolchain).
  optional-llm — npm run test:optional:golden-path-llm.
  Matrix связывает gate id, command, phase registration и verificationLoop rows.
Цель:
  Каждая фаза регистрирует checks; CI pipeline reproducible из package.json scripts.

Метки:
  atom.profile: prompt_rule
  protocol.id: workgraph-release-gate-matrix-v1
  work.source: design-workgraph-release-gate-matrix
  trace.status: verified
]>
